WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.000
please change God's Shield to God Shield.

00:07.220 --> 00:08.650
Hiiragi Renji.

00:12.010 --> 00:13.200
Kureha...

00:22.280 --> 00:24.700
Akari, take care of Kureha.

00:25.810 --> 00:28.510
Hiiragi Renji, what about you?

00:33.640 --> 00:35.880
I'm going to save Elis!

02:26.460 --> 02:29.220
Geizer... you...

02:29.220 --> 02:30.490
Anzelotte-sama!

02:30.490 --> 02:32.500
A Wizard is heading for Syaimaar!

02:34.510 --> 02:35.340
Hiiragi-san!

02:57.610 --> 02:58.960
Elis!

03:00.230 --> 03:01.520
Kirihito!

03:01.520 --> 03:03.730
You're still alive?

03:03.730 --> 03:07.260
Your existence no longer have a shred of value.

03:07.260 --> 03:09.810
It's useless trying to call for Elis.

03:09.810 --> 03:12.810
Only my voice can get through to her.

03:12.810 --> 03:17.130
Well of course, she is a marionette that I created.

03:17.130 --> 03:18.490
You're wrong!

03:18.490 --> 03:20.260
Elis is our friend!

03:20.260 --> 03:28.970
And I'm grateful, it's because of the bond you shared that she fell into despair in the end.

03:29.450 --> 03:35.210
Hiiragi Renji, your nickname, I've heard about it from Anzelotte.

03:35.780 --> 03:36.940
What was it again...

03:36.940 --> 03:39.010
Go to hell!

03:42.260 --> 03:46.510
Ah, I remember it now, it was the "fallen man", right?

03:51.510 --> 03:52.210
Hiiragi-san!

03:53.330 --> 03:59.010
Hiiragi Renji, I'll let Elis herself take your life away from you.

03:59.500 --> 04:02.020
Now Elis, take good aim.

04:06.380 --> 04:07.730
Elis...

04:19.430 --> 04:20.480
Anzelotte?

04:26.250 --> 04:29.670
Open a maximum protective barrier above Kimei Academy!

04:29.670 --> 04:31.200
Protect Hiiragi-san!

04:38.710 --> 04:40.130
Anzelotte.

04:40.750 --> 04:46.130
Our God, Geizer, I never thought I would ever disobey you.

04:47.030 --> 04:47.890
Koizumi.

04:47.890 --> 04:48.620
Yes ma'am!

04:48.620 --> 04:51.580
Open a metastasis barrier around Kimei Academy.

04:51.580 --> 04:55.190
We are going to isolate Syaimaar and Geizer from the rest of the world.

04:55.190 --> 04:56.350
Understood!

05:15.040 --> 05:18.330
Anzelotte, are you trying to go against me?

05:18.860 --> 05:28.430
It's the will of me, Geizer, to turn this failed world back into nothingness and to look after a better world.

05:28.970 --> 05:33.160
My duty is... to protect this world.

05:33.160 --> 05:36.520
Yes, I am... the protector of the world.

05:36.520 --> 05:38.100
Anzelotte!

05:39.220 --> 05:44.250
That's too bad. And I was actually a bit interested in you too.

05:44.850 --> 05:45.780
Syaimaar.

05:51.400 --> 05:56.210
You cannot stop me and Syaimaar with your power alone.

05:56.210 --> 05:58.670
I'll destroy everything, no matter what.

06:00.560 --> 06:06.920
Issue my order to all Wizards, Syaimaar... no... Geizer is to be destroyed no matter what!

06:08.130 --> 06:10.470
This is getting interesting.

06:10.470 --> 06:12.990
Leon, take care of everything else.

06:12.990 --> 06:14.510
Yes, Greater Devil Bell.

06:19.460 --> 06:20.770
How admirable.

06:35.230 --> 06:38.250
How humiliating, Hiiragi Renji.

06:38.250 --> 06:40.010
Bell Zephyr?!

06:40.010 --> 06:46.380
I am not obligated to lend a hand, but if we leave them alone, they'll destroy Rikai as well.

06:47.480 --> 06:50.130
Let's have a united front here, shall we?

06:51.950 --> 06:55.010
True, this isn't the time to be going after each other.

07:04.450 --> 07:08.880
Syaimaar's Light of Destruction. What's going on here...?

07:08.880 --> 07:10.930
Power of this level shouldn't be...

07:12.000 --> 07:15.160
It can't be... Elis, you're still...

07:16.850 --> 07:18.700
So nice to make your acquaintance.

07:19.280 --> 07:22.240
The Great Observer, The Geizer.

07:23.000 --> 07:25.390
Greater Devil Bell Zephyr, huh?

07:26.670 --> 07:30.340
Since when did you and Hiiragi Renji become friends?

07:30.340 --> 07:32.190
Just a moment ago.

07:32.190 --> 07:37.010
But, it's only until you're eliminated from this world!

07:39.830 --> 07:45.000
Even if you have the power of Rikai, you won't be able to break the Shield of God.

07:45.850 --> 07:46.440
Elis!

07:52.500 --> 07:54.410
A left over hope?

07:54.990 --> 07:58.250
Syaimaar's vessel is... Elis-san.

07:58.250 --> 08:01.610
That is where I will be bet my last hope.

08:01.610 --> 08:05.750
Sleeping inside of Syaimaar is Elis-san's will.

08:05.750 --> 08:07.710
We will re-awaken it.

08:07.710 --> 08:09.590
Nightmare-dono has arrived.

08:10.450 --> 08:12.010
Dream...

08:12.510 --> 08:16.760
It seems that... the time for my dream story to be of use has come.

08:17.580 --> 08:19.560
Divine Corona!

08:26.080 --> 08:27.610
This doesn't work either huh?

08:29.260 --> 08:33.650
It's no use, before the Shield of God, any attack is powerless.

08:34.470 --> 08:38.380
You've got to be kidding me, just what can I do to beat him?

08:38.380 --> 08:39.620
Hiiragi Renji-kun!

08:40.510 --> 08:41.980
Dream...

08:42.500 --> 08:45.740
I will now open a door to Elis-kun's dream world.

08:46.260 --> 08:47.620
Come with me.

08:47.620 --> 08:49.000
Dream world?

08:49.000 --> 08:49.670
That's right!

08:51.170 --> 08:55.220
Nightmare's dream story will now begin, dream...

08:55.630 --> 08:57.340
Clever.

08:57.340 --> 08:59.350
Your opponent is me.

08:59.670 --> 09:01.310
Vanity World!

09:01.310 --> 09:03.430
The Unlimited!

09:05.970 --> 09:07.350
Dream...

09:13.770 --> 09:15.490
Wait for me, Elis!

09:27.950 --> 09:30.960
This junction, we've been here before.

09:31.480 --> 09:33.000
Wait, Hiiragi-kun.

09:33.680 --> 09:35.150
Do you remember?

09:35.150 --> 09:40.300
When we entered her dream before, we met that boy here.

09:40.840 --> 09:43.580
We didn't go up these stairs.

09:44.140 --> 09:50.980
That's right. I went down since I didn't want to be around him.

09:51.470 --> 09:55.200
And if... that was exactly what he wanted?

09:55.200 --> 09:57.970
You mean he doesn't want us to go there?

10:04.880 --> 10:07.980
That door leads to the darkness in Elis' heart.

10:08.550 --> 10:10.710
I cannot go inside.

10:11.770 --> 10:14.170
From this point onwards, you have to go alone.

10:15.300 --> 10:16.830
You are prepared aren't you?

10:16.830 --> 10:20.260
Yes, I made a promise to Elis in her dream.

10:22.020 --> 10:24.560
That whatever happens, I will definitely protect her.

11:06.810 --> 11:07.520
Elis!

11:12.470 --> 11:15.180
Hiiragi...senpai...?

11:15.180 --> 11:17.340
I've come to get you, Elis!

11:20.310 --> 11:21.290
Elis?

11:21.780 --> 11:24.430
Because of me, Kureha-san was...

11:25.270 --> 11:28.620
I no longer have a place to return to...

11:28.620 --> 11:29.620
Elis...

11:30.440 --> 11:35.960
I am the monster who has lost her place to return to... Syaimaar...

11:41.560 --> 11:43.140
Akatsuki Tower, heavily damaged!

11:43.140 --> 11:45.300
Every Longinus member surrounding the area, retreat!

11:45.300 --> 11:48.010
Wizards' 2nd troop's are lost!

11:48.010 --> 11:49.020
Anzelotte-sama.

11:49.570 --> 11:52.010
Himuro Akari-dono has returned.

11:52.010 --> 11:55.740
Return? Did she leave the battle?

11:56.780 --> 11:57.650
Well...

11:58.570 --> 12:02.320
She was returning Akabane Kureha-dono's body.

12:03.950 --> 12:05.240
Kureha-san has...!

12:18.810 --> 12:21.260
Please forgive me, Kureha-san.

12:21.750 --> 12:28.330
I ordered you all to fight one another without realizing Geizer's true self.

12:28.330 --> 12:29.810
How foolish I was.

12:31.010 --> 12:33.640
I will now... break the ban.

12:35.250 --> 12:44.010
As the protector of the world, I'm not allowed to lend the power that I have directly to anyone.

12:44.010 --> 12:49.000
But, I no longer intend to follow Geizer.

12:49.490 --> 12:57.000
For the sake of the world, I will now bring back Kureha-san's soul which was lost for my foolishness.

13:16.510 --> 13:17.350
Anzelotte.

13:21.540 --> 13:29.030
Even for Anzelotte, to bring someone's soul taken by God back to life is not an easy task.

13:30.270 --> 13:33.490
But even so, for me to give up is not an option.

13:34.130 --> 13:39.290
Even if it costs me my life, I will make Kureha-san open her eyes once again.

13:55.940 --> 13:57.070
Leon Guntar!

13:57.820 --> 13:59.840
Why are you surprised?

13:59.840 --> 14:03.570
It's natural to cooperate if our goal is the same.

14:04.260 --> 14:08.690
Indeed, this is something that even Geizer would not have foreseen.

14:31.890 --> 14:36.350
Hiiragi... Elis... chan...

14:36.770 --> 14:37.720
Kureha-san!

14:37.720 --> 14:38.570
Kureha.

14:39.180 --> 14:41.400
Anzelotte, Akari...

14:42.110 --> 14:43.230
Where is Hiiragi?

14:43.770 --> 14:45.980
Where is Elis-chan?

14:47.770 --> 14:52.000
Shiho Elis' despair was brought on by the loss of her friend.

14:52.820 --> 14:55.830
With this, that reality has been changed.

14:55.830 --> 15:00.330
The only thing left to do is to open her heart.

15:02.890 --> 15:04.110
Stay back!

15:04.110 --> 15:05.660
I am Syaimaar!

15:05.660 --> 15:07.880
I can no longer be with you!

15:16.410 --> 15:19.100
You are... our friend.

15:19.740 --> 15:24.610
Together we laughed, cried, and fought as friends!

15:25.880 --> 15:28.390
Hiiragi...senpai...

15:29.000 --> 15:31.780
But I am no longer...

15:33.000 --> 15:34.920
Elis-chan!

15:44.510 --> 15:49.750
Elis-chan! I am okay! I'm alive and well!

15:50.370 --> 15:51.740
Kureha-san...

15:52.310 --> 15:53.550
Kureha!

16:02.920 --> 16:06.400
Don't worry Elis-chan, I'm really alive!

16:06.400 --> 16:08.730
I'm healthy and full of life!

16:11.030 --> 16:14.000
Akari, it's dangerous! Evade! Evade! Evade!

16:13.250 --> 16:17.010
It's her usual, overly loud voice!

16:17.010 --> 16:17.700
Yes!

16:18.160 --> 16:19.820
Let's go back, Elis-chan!

16:19.820 --> 16:24.080
Let's finish this fight up already and go back to our world!

16:24.510 --> 16:25.250
Elis.

16:26.260 --> 16:28.270
Let's go back Elis.

16:28.270 --> 16:31.000
Kureha and Akari... everyone is waiting.

16:33.450 --> 16:35.260
Today is your birthday, right?

16:36.050 --> 16:37.730
Let's go back and have a party.

16:38.250 --> 16:40.470
You'll bake the usual madelines, right?

16:44.000 --> 16:44.760
Sure!

16:53.900 --> 16:58.040
Shiho Elis' nightmare is over.

17:15.720 --> 17:21.150
From the captivity of Geizer, Shiho Elis's heart has... been set free.

17:21.150 --> 17:24.000
Elis-san and Hiiragi-san are coming back.

17:31.690 --> 17:32.820
Kirihito.

17:33.240 --> 17:35.810
Now you've done it, Hiiragi Renji.

17:36.310 --> 17:38.660
But in the end it will fail.

17:39.250 --> 17:41.260
I'll send you to your death.

17:41.680 --> 17:44.950
That way, Shiho Elis will once again fall into despair.

17:46.030 --> 17:49.610
Kirihito, I don't know who you are.

17:49.610 --> 17:51.840
But I'm not going to let you have your way!

17:52.260 --> 17:54.550
With neither Elis nor the world!

17:56.990 --> 18:04.280
I won't be able to stand against his Shield of God if I just blindly attack him.

18:04.760 --> 18:06.850
What are you going to do, Hiiragi Renji?!

18:08.870 --> 18:10.230
Eyes of All.

18:12.270 --> 18:14.610
Hiiragi-senpai, I will fight as well!

18:15.000 --> 18:16.010
Elis.

18:16.550 --> 18:17.190
Sure!

18:17.880 --> 18:22.000
My Broom, lend me your power just one more time.

18:22.000 --> 18:25.910
Together with Hiiragi-senpai, give me the power to protect the world!

18:47.540 --> 18:48.930
Geizer was hit?!

18:48.930 --> 18:50.890
It slipped through the Shield of God!

18:56.930 --> 18:59.010
Syaimaar's power.

19:00.530 --> 19:03.750
It passes through everything, Syaimaar's light.

19:04.230 --> 19:08.290
Even Geizer's Shield of God is no exception.

19:18.360 --> 19:19.260
The Shield of God!

19:19.740 --> 19:20.720
Has been broken.

19:21.030 --> 19:22.190
Hiiragi!

19:24.840 --> 19:26.680
Kirihito!

19:43.880 --> 19:46.990
This is why I hate you, Hiiragi Renji.

19:47.550 --> 19:50.580
From the very first time I met you, I have always detested you.

19:51.220 --> 19:54.750
I also hated you from the very beginning.

19:59.410 --> 20:01.540
Goodbye, Elis.

20:04.820 --> 20:06.850
Kirihito... kun...

20:09.500 --> 20:12.350
Good grief, this world is...

20:39.900 --> 20:42.890
Goodbye, Oji-sama.

20:45.050 --> 20:47.800
A new history has been carved.

20:48.370 --> 20:51.070
Because fate has been changed?

20:51.070 --> 20:51.970
Yes.

20:51.970 --> 20:56.300
I see, then the fun is about to begin once more, huh?

20:56.810 --> 20:58.940
See you again, Anzelotte.

20:59.400 --> 21:02.900
When that time comes, I'll be waiting to welcome you, Bell Zephyr.

21:06.010 --> 21:08.470
Hey, be sure to hold on tight!

21:09.600 --> 21:12.170
Is this how you handle an injured person?!

21:12.170 --> 21:15.780
Well you see, we're already over the allowed number of people, so it can't be helped.

21:15.780 --> 21:16.610
Dream.

21:16.610 --> 21:18.590
Begin the damage report.

21:19.000 --> 21:19.710
Yes.

21:35.270 --> 21:36.750
Taishi Tatsuke!

21:36.750 --> 21:37.250
Here!

21:37.890 --> 21:39.030
Congratulations.

21:39.760 --> 21:40.810
Hiiragi Renji!

21:42.300 --> 21:44.760
Hiiragi? He could actually graduate?

21:44.760 --> 21:46.610
He was that "fallen" guy wasn't he?

21:47.110 --> 21:48.900
Is Hiiragi Renji absent?!

21:50.260 --> 21:51.560
That idiot.

21:51.560 --> 21:53.250
Wait a second!

21:55.110 --> 21:59.510
Hiiragi Renji... is here for his graduation ceremony!!

22:00.010 --> 22:01.610
Here, congratulations.

22:01.610 --> 22:03.010
Thank you!

22:08.610 --> 22:10.890
I graduated!!

22:17.520 --> 22:18.790
Sorry to keep you waiting!

22:19.000 --> 22:20.220
You're late!

22:20.220 --> 22:25.690
Sorry sorry, I have too many juniors, they kept stopping me.

22:27.760 --> 22:28.580
What?

22:29.060 --> 22:31.800
I never thought this day would really come...

22:31.800 --> 22:34.570
That you could graduate is a miracle.

22:34.910 --> 22:38.020
By any chance, did you use Anzelotte's connections?

22:38.020 --> 22:39.050
Don't be an idiot!

22:39.450 --> 22:42.950
Hiiragi Renji, finally, you've cleared your name.

22:44.030 --> 22:47.180
I'm not letting anyone call me the "fallen man" anymore!

22:47.180 --> 22:48.590
I wonder about that.

22:48.590 --> 22:52.350
Maybe you'll be transfered to Akarin's class this coming semester.

22:52.350 --> 22:54.480
Don't make it sound like a curse!

22:56.000 --> 23:00.210
Hiiragi-senpai, Kureha-san, congratulations on your graduation.

23:00.210 --> 23:02.260
Thank you, Elis.

23:02.260 --> 23:05.270
Elis-chan! That new uniform really fits you!

23:05.270 --> 23:06.750
Thank you!

23:06.750 --> 23:09.910
Now that everyone is here, shall we party?

23:10.000 --> 23:12.440
I want to eat meat, meat!

23:12.440 --> 23:14.620
You always want meat.

23:14.620 --> 23:17.480
It's not good for your body if you don't have some vegetables sometimes too.

23:17.480 --> 23:20.620
Idiot, my wound still hasn't healed.

23:20.620 --> 23:23.540
You idiot! It won't heal if you don't eat vegetables!

23:22.250 --> 23:23.540
Is something wrong?

23:23.540 --> 23:25.750
No, it's nothing.

23:25.750 --> 23:30.230
I'm just happy that we both safely got to the third year.

23:30.230 --> 23:33.090
Of course, we're not Hiiragi Renji.

23:33.090 --> 23:36.800
Hey, did you just say something rude about me just now?

23:36.800 --> 23:38.980
Not really, it was nothing.

23:38.980 --> 23:40.780
Hiiragi-san!

23:41.920 --> 23:42.980
That voice is...

23:42.980 --> 23:43.750
Don't tell me...

23:43.750 --> 23:47.800
Congratulations on your graduation, Hiiragi-san!

23:47.800 --> 23:50.150
Now then, it's time for your next mission!

23:50.150 --> 23:53.740
N-No way! Today is my graduation!

23:50.720 --> 23:55.410
Please answer to my next request which I am going to ask you with either 'Yes' or 'Okay'.

23:59.200 --> 24:01.030
What is this?!

24:01.030 --> 24:04.080
I beg you! Let me live a normal life!

24:04.600 --> 24:07.180
Hiiragi Renji, the "rising man".

24:07.180 --> 24:09.030
Have a safe trip!

24:09.030 --> 24:10.510
Please do your best!

24:21.860 --> 24:26.270
Hiiragi-senpai, I will... do my best just as I am.

24:27.440 --> 24:35.030
Although I have lost the power to fight alongside you, from now on, as a friend, can I stay by your side?
